   "stem_html": "Have foodborne illnesses related to biofilms changed over time? Explain.",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1016643,
     "content_html": "Yes, better sterilization and canning procedures have reduced the incidence of botulism. Most cases of foodborne illness now are related to small-scale food production."
